'''Ururun Wolf''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can be unlocked at a 30% chance when completing [[The Great Escaper]]. She was added in [[Version 2.3 Update#Version 2.3.1 Update|Version 2.3.1]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] increases health, damage, range and grants [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]]. In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], she has a 5% chance to be unlocked when beating [[The Big Bang (Cats of the Cosmos)|The Big Bang]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is guaranteed to recruit her when beating The Great Escaper.

